    {
      "en": "I arrive at the bar with Sana to find the place already decked out in...well, not decorations, but whatever weird light bulbs Sara normally uses to make the color in here all pink and whatnot.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Apart from the lights, however, it doesn’t really appear that things have gotten underway as of yet.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I mean, there are no guests around- not even Maki and Haruka. And given that this place has been doing a little better than normal lately, that’s kind of disappointing.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’m not really sure why I’m thinking so much about it, though, when I clearly have more important things to be doing.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Like helping Sana get dressed.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you require assistance?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...I’m sorry?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Picking out clothes.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or putting them on, I guess.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No.",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, I think I’m okay...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Fuck Halloween.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Everything I’m supposed to bring to the party is...pretty light...so you can just stay down here and wait for me to get back...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you sure you don’t need me to come up there and help with anything?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentwobar2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentwobar2.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentwobar2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uh...well...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I kind of...yelled at you the last time we were up there together, so...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think it’s probably best if you just stay down here...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes. I can see how having me closer to your mother is better at quelling your uncertainty about our relationship than having me in her room with you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...it sounds weird when you put it like that...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because it is weird. But if that’s what you want, it’s fine by me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Could be good to catch up with her anyway.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just...don’t catch up too much...hahah...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hah...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentwobar3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentwobar3.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentwobar3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Well...that’s that, I guess.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
