    {
      "en": "scene halloweentwobar5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentwobar5.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentwobar5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, if it isn’t my favorite customer!",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, Sara. You’re looking mostly sober tonight.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You too, Yuki.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentwobar6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentwobar6.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentwobar6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey! How come your voice sounded a lot more gentle when you said that to her?",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Probably because Yuki’s sobriety is something we should be praising and yours is something we should be encouraging.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thanks, man. Sara’s not that far gone yet, though. ‘Least not from what I’ve seen.",
      "spk": "Yuki",
      "spkColor": "#CDCDCD",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll have you know I’ve been doing much better lately when it comes to not drinking while the bar is open.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I wait until the doors are closed now.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, that’s a step in the right direction, I guess.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentwobar7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentwobar7.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentwobar7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, are you going to stay for the Halloween party again this year? Maki and Haruka are on their way over now.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And, if the rumors I’ve heard are true, their costumes are even more...risque this year.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Speaking of which, where’s yours? You seem like the type to pretty much always dress up for stuff like this.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not tonight.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...at least not until I know how business is going to be.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sure we won’t be like, actually busy or anything, but I still have Yuki and your friend from the last party coming to temp for the night while Sana is out being a [teenager].",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Basically, I am prepared to work if I have to. And since my feminine wiles don’t work as well on our female clientele, I don’t have to get dressed up. I just want to.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentwobar8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentwobar8.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentwobar8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Besides, Yuki’s popular enough with the girls to make it so I barely even have to do anything.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yuki is? Really?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentwobar9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentwobar9.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentwobar9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yo. The fuck is that supposed to mean?",
      "spk": "Yuki",
      "spkColor": "#CDCDCD",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, don’t ask me. You’re the one always calling yourself “not cute” or whatever.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not my fault that a bunch of girls are just settlin’ for the closest thing to a dude they can get with all the real ones up in space or whatever the fuck is goin’ on.",
      "spk": "Yuki",
      "spkColor": "#CDCDCD",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’d be willing to bet cash that any girl with short hair’s gettin’ the same fuckin’ treatment I am.",
      "spk": "Yuki",
      "spkColor": "#CDCDCD",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentwobar10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentwobar10.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentwobar10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, stop. That uniform looks absolutely adorable on you. It’s no wonder so many girls are flocking to the place now.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, sure the fuckin’ fliers you’ve been handin’ out to everyone and their mothers have nothin’ to do with it.",
      "spk": "Yuki",
      "spkColor": "#CDCDCD",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Fliers mean nothing in the face of true beauty, Yuki.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Guh.",
      "spk": "Yuki",
      "spkColor": "#CDCDCD",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Yuki",
      "spkColor": "#CDCDCD",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Good. Now, kiss.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentwobar11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentwobar11.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentwobar11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I suppose one wouldn’t hurt if that’s what you want to see, Sensei.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The fuck, dude?! No! Not only is she a chick, she’s my boss now!",
      "spk": "Yuki",
      "spkColor": "#CDCDCD",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ‘Sides, what if people fuckin’ walk in or whatever? Can’t say I’d wanna spend my money at some place where the employees are fucking behind the counters.",
      "spk": "Yuki",
      "spkColor": "#CDCDCD",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentwobar12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentwobar12.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentwobar12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean...I don’t think Sensei said anything about fucking...but I’d be lying if I said I wasn’t at least a little curious...",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, you’ve gotta be fucking kidding me. You too?",
      "spk": "Yuki",
      "spkColor": "#CDCDCD",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re just really popular now, Yuki. Embrace it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentwobar13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentwobar13.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentwobar13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hah...whatever. ‘Least I’m gettin’ paid.",
      "spk": "Yuki",
      "spkColor": "#CDCDCD",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m still waiting on an answer to whether or not you’re staying, Sensei.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sure someone like you would be preeeetty popular around a bunch of sexually dissatisfied women.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Assuming they show up, that is.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": As fond as I am of sexually dissatisfied women, I’m not sure if I’m able to hang around this time.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Pretty sure the party for my class is basically underway already.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Not to mention I’d much prefer being in a room full of primarily virgins than one with a handful of women who have been around the block a few times.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sue me.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentwobar14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentwobar14.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentwobar14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you really gonna say no to these cute little faces?",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We need you, Sensei~",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We need you to save our bar...and our bodies...",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think I’m good, actually. Not in the best shape anymore, but don’t think I need saving yet.",
      "spk": "Yuki",
      "spkColor": "#CDCDCD",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentwobar15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentwobar15.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentwobar15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Really? Because I’d think that if anyone in this room needed saving, it would be you.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Dude, there are three people in this room. And you two are making it pretty clear you fuck like rabbits already, so...",
      "spk": "Yuki",
      "spkColor": "#CDCDCD",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if sarasex == True:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentwobar16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentwobar16.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentwobar16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Weeeeeell...I don’t know if rabbits is the right word...",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uh-huh. Sure, boss.",
      "spk": "Yuki",
      "spkColor": "#CDCDCD",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Now, can you let go of my chin? You’re startin’ to leave a mark.",
      "spk": "Yuki",
      "spkColor": "#CDCDCD",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "else:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentwobar17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentwobar17.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentwobar17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh...no.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei and I are just friends, actually.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just get a little flirty around him sometimes.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Really? Well, sure had me fooled.",
      "spk": "Yuki",
      "spkColor": "#CDCDCD",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sara goes silent for a moment before finally removing her finger from Yuki’s chin.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Before the conversation is able to pick back up, however, the “friend of mine” that Sara alluded to earlier finally decides to walk in...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentwobar18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentwobar18.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentwobar18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hello, attractive bartender woman!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have returned to this building of female fornication for the purpose of pouring liquids into hollow glass cylinders and making people dizzy!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please pay me in feathers!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wha-",
      "spk": "Yuki",
      "spkColor": "#CDCDCD",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Welcome back, Kaori.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentwobar19",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentwobar19.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentwobar19"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah! Friend! You are here as well!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you intend to fornicate with the bar lady or her handsome friend with sadbags under her eyes?",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
